od Training Coordinator should:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyse completion data."},{"text":"Segment employees by department/location/role."},{"text":"Identify why employees are not completing it."},{"text":"Check training duration and scheduling."},{"text":"Send targeted reminders."},{"text":"Coordinate with managers."},{"text":"Offer additional sessions."},{"text":"Track completion through the LMS."},{"text":"Report department-wise completion."},{"text":"Escalate persistent non-compliance."},{"text":"Measure improvement after intervention."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply \"conduct training.\""},{"type":"p","text":"It is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Need","Design","Delivery","Participation","Learning","Behaviour","Business Impact"]},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government HR departments"},{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Government training institutes"},{"text":"Administrative training institutions"},{"text":"Skill-development organisations"},{"text":"Public-sector banks"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Government education institutions"},{"text":"Defence/public-sector training administration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential titles can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR Executive"},{"text":"Training Officer"},{"text":"Personnel Officer"},{"text":"Administrative Officer"},{"text":"HR/Training Assistant"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility, examinations, experience requirements, and recruitment rules vary by organisation and post."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Strong Options"},{"type":"table","header":["PG","Best For"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA HR"},{"text":"HR/L&D management"}],[{"text":"MBA HR & Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"People development"}],[{"text":"MBA Learning & Development"},{"text":"Corporate L&D"}],[{"text":"MA/M.Sc Psychology"},{"text":"Organizational/people development"}],[{"text":"MA Human Resource Management"},{"text":"HR specialization"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in HR"},{"text":"Faster professional specialization"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"HR analytics"}],[{"text":"MSc HR Analytics / People Analytics"},{"text":"Data-driven HR"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Route"},{"type":"p","text":"For corporate L&D, a postgraduate degree is helpful but not mandatory."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA HR","L&D Internship","Training Coordinator","L&D Specialist","MBA HR"]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"New Zealand"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant programs:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Resource Management"},{"text":"Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Learning & Development"},{"text":"Organizational Development"},{"text":"Talent Management"},{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"Human Capital Management"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international careers, combine HR knowledge with people analytics, organizational psychology, technology, and strategic workforce development."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BBA HRM","HR / L&D Intern","Training Coordinator","Training / L&D Executive","L&D Specialist","Senior L&D Specialist","Training Manager","L&D Manager","Talent Development / OD Leader","Head of L&D","HR Director / Chief People Officer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Analytics Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA HRM","Training Coordinator","Learning Analyst","People Analytics / Learning Analytics Specialist","Senior Analyst","People Analytics Manager","HR An